Hey! Here's What I Built

I developed a simple console-based Python project called VITyarthi Healthcare Awareness Campaign.

The main purpose of this project is to provide students with information about different healthcare awareness campaigns and allow them to register for these events.

The project is designed as a beginner-friendly Python application that demonstrates how programming can be used to organize student information and promote health awareness on campus.

---

What My Project Can Do

- Display available healthcare awareness campaigns
- Show the date, time and venue of each campaign
- Register students for a selected campaign
- Store student details such as:
  - Name
  - Registration Number
  - Branch
  - Student Type
- Display registered student information
- Provide useful health-awareness information
- Manage campaign-related data using Python lists and dictionaries

