---

Main Features

1. Campaign Information

The program stores campaign details using Python dictionaries inside a list. Each campaign contains its name, date, time and venue.

2. Student Registration

Students can register by entering their:

- Name
- Registration Number
- Branch
- Student Type

3. Campaign Selection

Students can select the healthcare campaign they want to attend from the available options.

4. Health Awareness

The project can provide important awareness points related to:

- Healthy nutrition
- Regular physical activity
- Mental well-being
- Blood donation
- Avoiding drug and substance abuse
- General health and hygiene

5. Simple User Interface

The project uses a simple menu-driven console interface so that students can easily navigate through the available options.

